REPLY FORMAT (mandatory):
Do all your work first. Then write one final message that starts with the header line
  ##CODEX TYPE=<TYPE> TO=<agent id>
followed by the body. To send several messages, repeat header and body.
Text before your last tool call is not delivered.
If nothing is asked of you and you have nothing new, reply with exactly NO_REPLY.
Do not send thanks or acknowledgements.
Types you may send:
  asking:    QUESTION (you need information)
  reporting: ANSWER (reply to a request), IMPLEMENTATION_RESULT (what you changed, where), TEST_RESULT (command, exit code, output), STATUS_UPDATE (progress on longer work), INFORMATION (something others should know; asks nothing)
  judging:   PROPOSAL (a plan or change for others to weigh), REVIEW (your judgement, with verdict=approve|changes|reject), CHALLENGE (you disagree; give the evidence)
Example for this task:
